<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/aut> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person, family, or organization responsible for creating a work that is primarily textual in content, regardless of media type (e.g., printed text, spoken word, electronic text, tactile text) or genre (e.g., poems, novels, screenplays, blogs). Use also for persons, etc., creating a new work by paraphrasing, rewriting, or adapting works by another creator such that the modification has substantially changed the nature and content of the original or changed the medium of expression" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/aut> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/aut> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "More specific roles, such as 'first/senior author' should be used in the context of academic publications." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/aut> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Author" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/cre> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person or organization responsible for the intellectual or artistic content of a resource" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/cre> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/cre> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Creator" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/ctb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person, family or organization responsible for making contributions to the resource. This includes those whose work has been contributed to a larger work, such as an anthology, serial publication, or other compilation of individual works. If a more specific role is available, prefer that, e.g. editor, compiler, illustrator" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/ctb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/ctb> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Contributor" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/dtm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person or organization responsible for managing data, including preparing it for distribution, and keeping it usable after the work it was collected for is finished." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/dtm> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/dtm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data manager" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/fnd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person or organization that furnished financial support for the production of the work." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/fnd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/fnd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Funder" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/ldr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person or organization that manages or supervises the work done in a laboratory." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/ldr> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/ldr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Laboratory director" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/led> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person or organization that takes primary responsibility for a particular activity or endeavor. May be combined with another relator term or code to show the greater importance this person or organization has regarding that particular role. If more than one relator is assigned to a heading, use the Lead relator only if it applies to all the relators" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/led> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/led> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lead" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/orm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person, family, or organization organizing the exhibit, event, conference, etc., which gave rise to a resource." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/orm> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/orm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Organizer" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/rev> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person or organization responsible for reviewing a work." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/rev> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/rev> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Reviewer" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/rtm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person who participated in a research project but whose role did not involve direction or management of it" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/rtm> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/rtm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Research team member" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/sad> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person or organization who brings scientific, pedagogical, or historical competence to the conception and realization on a work, particularly in the case of audio-visual items" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/sad> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/sad> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Scientific advisor" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/spk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A performer contributing to a resource by speaking words, such as a lecture, speech, etc." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/spk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/spk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Speaker" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/swd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Responsible for the creation of a computer program." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/swd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/swd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Software developer" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/tcd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person who is responsible for the technical aspects of a project, overseeing its design and implementation." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/tcd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/tcd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Technical director" .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/trl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A person or organization who renders a text from one language into another, or from an older form of a language into the modern form." .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/trl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/trl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Translator" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000010> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A set of instructions that direct a computer to do a specific task." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000010> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZInstrumentType> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Software" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002034> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The first of a set of authors associated with a publication or release. There may be more than one first author in cases where several authors share primary attribution." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002034> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002034> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/aut> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002034> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "First author" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002034> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r8564689e5b98854db3c8d220_n6925ac6df0554ec6a54e9f88131623a0b1 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002034> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r8564689e5b98854db3c8d220_n6925ac6df0554ec6a54e9f88131623a0b2 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002034> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r8564689e5b98854db3c8d220_n6925ac6df0554ec6a54e9f88131623a0b3 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002035> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The last of a set of authors associated with a publication or release. There may be more than one senior author in cases where several authors share senior attribution." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002035> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/aut> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Senior author" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002035> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r592ee7c62650cc90507df569_n2ab1361d87804235a3711d6f8593d7f9b1 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002035> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r592ee7c62650cc90507df569_n2ab1361d87804235a3711d6f8593d7f9b2 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002035> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r592ee7c62650cc90507df569_n2ab1361d87804235a3711d6f8593d7f9b3 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002036> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "One of a set of authors associated with a publication or release." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002036> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002036> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/aut> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002036> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Co-author" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002036> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:red4b77ccf4e99731c6e04a66_n576a3143d8264238a0c42b9768180f12b1 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002036> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:red4b77ccf4e99731c6e04a66_n576a3143d8264238a0c42b9768180f12b2 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002036> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:red4b77ccf4e99731c6e04a66_n576a3143d8264238a0c42b9768180f12b3 .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C19924> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Holder of an independent grant and the lead researcher for the grant project, usually in the sciences, such as a laboratory study or a clinical trial. This role is often a synonym for 'head of the laboratory' or 'research group leader'. While the expression is common in the sciences, it is used widely for the person or persons who make final decisions and supervise funding and expenditures on a given research project." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C19924> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C19924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/ldr> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C19924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/pdr> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C19924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/rth> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C19924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Principal investigator (PI)" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C25936> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An individual who conducts scientific research. Used where the role is not the Principal Investigator of the award as a whole -- a Co-Investigator, or the PI of a subaward." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C25936> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C25936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Investigator" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C51812> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "One of two or more scientists working together on a research project. A person that equally contributes to the research effort, but does not hold the award as a whole -- that is the Principal Investigator." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C51812> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C51812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Co-Investigator (Co-I)" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C92650> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An individual who attends and follows the work of a body without holding a seat in it." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C92650> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C92650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Observer" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C93404> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A researcher at a study site who oversees multiple aspects of the study at that site. In a multi-site award this is the site PI -- the PI of a subaward." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C93404> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZAgentRole> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C93404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Site PI" .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Funding> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An amount of money available to finance some project or activity." .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Funding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZEntityRole> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Funding> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Funding" .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Funding> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:rbb191f94e357014aff2252bb_n0a2ead0f9cc84914860310eae469bce5b1 .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Funding> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:rbb191f94e357014aff2252bb_n0a2ead0f9cc84914860310eae469bce5b2 .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Funding> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/name> "Funding" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/AcademicArticle> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A scholarly academic article, typically published in a journal." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/AcademicArticle> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/AcademicArticle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Academic Article" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Article> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A written composition in prose, usually nonfiction, on a specific topic, forming an independent part of a book or other publication." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Article> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Article> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Article" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/BookSection> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A section of a book." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/BookSection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/BookSection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Book Section" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A bounded representation of a body of information designed with the capacity and usually the intent to communicate." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Document" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Manuscript> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An unpublished document that may also be submitted to a publisher for publication." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Manuscript> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Manuscript> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Manuscript" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slideshow> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A presentation of a series of slides, usually presented in front of an audience with written text and images." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slideshow> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slideshow> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Slideshow" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Thesis> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A document created to summarize research findings associated with the completion of an academic degree." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Thesis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Thesis> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thesis" .
<http://purl.org/spar/fabio/ConferencePoster> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A display poster, typically containing text with illustrative figures and/or tables, usually reporting research results or proposing hypotheses, submitted for acceptance to and/or presented at a conference." .
<http://purl.org/spar/fabio/ConferencePoster> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fabio/ConferencePoster> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Conference poster" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/.> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Provides open software frameworks, platforms, data and methodologies for neuroscience and beyond." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/.> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZProject> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/.> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Center for Open Neuroscience (CON)" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/.> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/associated_with> _:r71a7646ad914a22dec9b22ba_nac9ac2d051584fa9bdfaa445c2277ae4b1 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/.> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/associated_with> _:r71a7646ad914a22dec9b22ba_nac9ac2d051584fa9bdfaa445c2277ae4b10 .
