<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/stamped-skills-assessment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZInstrument> .
