<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/reproman> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "ReproMan - Reproducible Computational Environments Manager" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/repronim-containers> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ReproNim/containers is a DataLad dataset providing a ready-to-use \"distribution\" of containerized neuroimaging environments (Singularity images) for reproducible analysis. It collects a curated set of containers — including those used by HeuDiConv and the broader ReproNim ecosystem — and exposes them via the ///repronim/containers DataLad dataset path, making it trivial to pin and share exact software environments alongside data and workflows." .
