<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/reprostim> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Automated capture of the audio-visual stimuli actually presented during an experiment, into BIDS datasets -- so what the participant saw and heard is recorded rather than inferred from the script that was supposed to show it. ReproFlow is the setup around it, from the screen and the event relay through to the dataset." .
