_:r14ec37db081c61dcec704dc9_nf89576089b024766909157279beac8a6b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://datasets.datalad.org\">datasets.datalad.org</a> is the instance of the original <a href=\"#datalad\">DataLad</a> distribution. It provides access to a wide collection of data from various initiatives, such as <a href=\"https://datasets.datalad.org/?dir=/openfmri\">OpenfMRI</a>, and hosts some datasets directly. A single <code>datalad install</code> of its superdataset reaches all of them, which arguably makes it one of the largest hierarchies of nested git repositories out there. </p>" .
