_:r1e4d709e7ddbc5e446835024_n1349b996a1c84a4cb9eda7db7c2baaf3b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "PI of <a href=\"/projects#openneuro_\">OpenNeuro</a> and, before it, of <a href=\"https://openfmri.org\">OpenfMRI</a>, and, with Chris Gorgolewski, the creator of <a href=\"/projects#brain_imaging_data_structure_bids_\">BIDS</a>, which <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1162/imag_a_00103\">grew out of the OpenfMRI layout</a>. The collaboration began with <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1467-9280.2009.02460.x\">decoding mental states across individuals</a> and continued with making OpenfMRI datasets available through <a href=\"/projects#datalad_\">DataLad</a>." .
