_:r293ae81d700bda818efbfb88_n910f6a54a837442bb224ba4bc6e78828b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "The technology research and development project within ReproNim that YOH leads at Dartmouth. In practice it is the tooling that makes a study reproducible end to end: capturing what the scanner and the stimulus computer actually did, converting it into standard layouts without a human in the loop, and re-running the analysis in a recorded environment." .
