_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Runs processing pipelines directly on DANDI assets, rather than asking everyone to download them first. Orchestration, a submission client and a public queue; the first campaign puts the AIND ephys pipeline over electrophysiology dandisets." .
_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> .
_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "DANDI Compute" .
_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_n8daaae44a0a2474bbd75172f50a30aacb7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/dandi-compute\">DANDI Compute</a> runs processing pipelines directly on <a href=\"/projects#dandi_\">DANDI</a> assets, rather than asking everyone to download them first. The first campaign applies the <a href=\"https://github.com/AllenNeuralDynamics/aind-ephys-pipeline\">AIND ephys pipeline</a> to electrophysiology dandisets. </p> <ul> <li> <a href=\"https://github.com/dandi-compute/dandi-compute-core\">dandi-compute-core</a>: orchestration and queue management. </li> <li> <a href=\"https://github.com/dandi-compute/dandi-compute-runner\">dandi-compute-runner</a>: submits jobs. </li> <li> <a href=\"https://github.com/dandi-compute/queue\">queue</a>: the processing queue, in public. </li> </ul>" .
