_:r45d6d652fe2d6ca5a2142b54_nb425a0e8328944eeb8aa6ff6aaf49c7eb7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> .
