_:r6f5c992ffa87b33f68d07ce4_n254b026c5fe84630babebfb9009c60bdb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r6f5c992ffa87b33f68d07ce4_n254b026c5fe84630babebfb9009c60bdb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/yarikoptic/svgtune\">svgtune</a> generates a set of SVG files from a single (Inkscape) drawing by toggling the visibility, style or placement of its layers and groups, as directed by a short script -- the way to build incremental slides, or to extract a panel of a poster that is regenerated whenever the poster changes. Written in 2009 and <a href=\"https://packages.debian.org/svgtune\">packaged for Debian</a>, it was revived in 2026 with <code>%only</code>, <code>%prune</code> and <code>%crop</code> directives and a test suite. </p>" .
