_:r7f240192e3d5330f1c6a2c5f_n20b53812a6fc487d985988cf05b8d856b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
