_:r7f240192e3d5330f1c6a2c5f_n20b53812a6fc487d985988cf05b8d856b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
_:r7f240192e3d5330f1c6a2c5f_n20b53812a6fc487d985988cf05b8d856b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r7f240192e3d5330f1c6a2c5f_n20b53812a6fc487d985988cf05b8d856b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Data connoisseur responsible for creating many software packages through the <a href=\"/projects#nwb_\">NWB</a> and <a href=\"/projects#dandi_\">DANDI</a> ecosystem (<a href=\"https://github.com/catalystneuro/neuroconv\">NeuroConv</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NeurodataWithoutBorders/nwbinspector\">NWB Inspector</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NeurodataWithoutBorders/nwb-guide\">NWB GUIDE</a>). Experienced in uploading several hundred terabytes of neurophysiology datasets to NIH archives. Currently working on <a href=\"https://github.com/dandi/dandi-infrastructure\">DANDI infrastructure</a>." .
_:r7f240192e3d5330f1c6a2c5f_n20b53812a6fc487d985988cf05b8d856b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/tier> .
