_:r8f475cd3edf78e84f8b2d2b6_n6c55ccb076ee43ae859982525a034624b11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "con/solidation" .
_:r8f475cd3edf78e84f8b2d2b6_n6c55ccb076ee43ae859982525a034624b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
_:r8f475cd3edf78e84f8b2d2b6_n6c55ccb076ee43ae859982525a034624b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r8f475cd3edf78e84f8b2d2b6_n6c55ccb076ee43ae859982525a034624b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/con/solidation\">con/solidation</a> is a command-line tool that produces a Markdown activity report of recent issue and pull-request events across a configured set of GitHub repositories and organizations. It is used by CON to generate regular summaries of activity across the projects it maintains and contributes to, enabling lightweight project-health monitoring without leaving the terminal. </p>" .
