_:r9932725f33a24a7f2ee43414_n30d24899417a4cd58033d35bd6dd48acb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
_:r9932725f33a24a7f2ee43414_n30d24899417a4cd58033d35bd6dd48acb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r9932725f33a24a7f2ee43414_n30d24899417a4cd58033d35bd6dd48acb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "MyKrok (Ukrainian: \"мій крок\" — \"my step\") is a CLI tool to incrementally back up fitness activities from Strava, including GPS tracks, photos, comments, and kudos. Backups are browsable offline through a built-in web frontend with interactive maps and activity statistics — applying the same git-annex / open-data philosophy of CON's archival tools to personal fitness data. Try the live demo with synthetic data." .
