_:r9f052cb6a26dbe7284d6b2e0_nf5bbd639ad8742b888e54c748f412c53b21 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
_:r9f052cb6a26dbe7284d6b2e0_nf5bbd639ad8742b888e54c748f412c53b21 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r9f052cb6a26dbe7284d6b2e0_nf5bbd639ad8742b888e54c748f412c53b21 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Founding Director of the Center for Open Neuroscience. Research Professor of Psychological and Brain Sciences and Adjunct Professor of Computer Science at Dartmouth College. Official Debian Developer and open source contributor leading DANDI, DataLad, PyMVPA, and NeuroDebian projects. Serves on BIDS and NWB technical advisory committees." .
_:r9f052cb6a26dbe7284d6b2e0_nf5bbd639ad8742b888e54c748f412c53b22 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
_:r9f052cb6a26dbe7284d6b2e0_nf5bbd639ad8742b888e54c748f412c53b22 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r9f052cb6a26dbe7284d6b2e0_nf5bbd639ad8742b888e54c748f412c53b22 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Research Professor of Psychological and Brain Sciences and Adjunct Professor of Computer Science at Dartmouth, official Debian Developer, contributor to <a href=\"https://www.openhub.net/accounts/yarikoptic\">many</a> open source projects -- Yaroslav (AKA Yarik) is a lead of <a href=\"/projects#dandi_\">DANDI</a>, <a href=\"/projects#datalad_\">DataLad</a>, <a href=\"/projects#pymvpa_\">PyMVPA</a>, <a href=\"/projects#neurodebian_\">NeuroDebian</a>, and other <a href=\"/projects\">projects</a>. He is also currently serving on BIDS standard Steering and <a href=\"/projects#nwb_\">NWB</a> standard technical advisory committees, and engaged in various other initiatives, projects, and efforts." .
