_:rbb2ab5c95963f401888f8e7d_n991f4cd2b6e54de3ab7b8b7cffd011c7b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
