_:rbb2ab5c95963f401888f8e7d_n991f4cd2b6e54de3ab7b8b7cffd011c7b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "con/fscacher is a Python library providing a persistent, file-content-aware memoization cache. Functions decorated with @cache.memoize_path are re-executed only when the fingerprint (timestamps + size) of their file arguments changes — making it easy to cache expensive operations on large file trees without stale results. It is used internally by the DANDI client and other CON tools." .
