_:rc658d771ddb2cfeccecfc7f7_nc0eb391c87874bb7bb3d6b761e6835dab1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/yaroslav-halchenko> .
