_:rcb9ad497d87096d02d26e206_n3eee0d57c35941fea800c096aaa56b6eb16 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "STAMPED Principles" .
_:rcb9ad497d87096d02d26e206_n3eee0d57c35941fea800c096aaa56b6eb17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/homepage> .
