_:rd17600b284790067e4d1d8ea_n1c2adebd52ae42518ec8e344354e6992b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://emberarchive.org\">Ecosystem for Multi-modal Brain-behavior Experimentation and Research (EMBER)</a> is the <a href=\"https://braininitiative.nih.gov/\">BRAIN Initiative</a> archive for multi-modal neurophysiological and behavioral data, supporting the <a href=\"https://braininitiative.nih.gov/research/systems-neuroscience/brain-behavior-quantification-and-synchronization-program\">Brain Behavior Quantification and Synchronization (BBQS) Program</a>. The platform is being kick-started based on DANDI to provide data upload and distribution. CON is working on integration with DANDI and involved standards. </p> <figure> <a href=\"https://hearth.emberarchive.org\"><img src=\"/theme/img/3rd/hearth_logo.svg\" alt=\"HEARTH\" class=\"pull-left\" style=\"width:100px;padding-right:5px;margin-top:0em;\" /></a> </figure> <p> <a href=\"https://hearth.emberarchive.org\">HEARTH</a> is EMBER's companion suite of data management tools, providing apps for preparing media prior to submission and publication on EMBER. </p> <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1em;margin:0.5em 0 1em;\"> <div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:220px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.6em;\"> <a href=\"https://hearth.emberarchive.org\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;\"> <img src=\"/theme/img/3rd/hearth_clip_extractor_logo.svg\" alt=\"Clip Extractor\" style=\"width:36px;\" /> </a> <p style=\"margin:0;\"> <a href=\"https://hearth.emberarchive.org\"><strong>Clip Extractor</strong></a><br /> for excerpting and preparing behavioral video clips for submission. </p> </div> <div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:220px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.6em;\"> <a href=\"https://hearth.emberarchive.org\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;\"> <img src=\"/theme/img/3rd/hearth_encoding_helper_logo.svg\" alt=\"Encoding Helper\" style=\"width:36px;\" /> </a> <p style=\"margin:0;\"> <a href=\"https://hearth.emberarchive.org\"><strong>Encoding Helper</strong></a><br /> for analyzing and transcoding media prior to publication on EMBER. </p> </div> </div>" .
