_:rd5783ea9f8c3dce62070c919_n4818bdfd9cad4387a12d85534982fe52b11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "mechababs runs BIDS Apps over many studies on an HPC cluster, with BABS running the jobs. It works on a BIDS study, adding derivatives to it, and records how each one was made inside the study itself: the exact mechababs and BABS versions pinned in a lock, and every orchestration step as a DataLad run record. A superstudy groups many studies so one campaign sweeps them all, which is how mechababs feeds OpenNeuroStudies." .
