_:rf22bac21705da27627d3081f_nb64122b871e14bcba68a1cb70ad25179b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "TemplateFlow: FAIR-sharing of multi-scale, multi-species brain models" .
_:rf22bac21705da27627d3081f_nb64122b871e14bcba68a1cb70ad25179b11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language> .
